        {
          "es": "Unos días antes, las aldeas caminan en largas procesiones hasta el mar.",
          "en": "A few days before, villages walk in long processions down to the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Llevan objetos sagrados de sus templos, bajo altas sombrillas, para lavarlos y purificarlos.",
          "en": "They carry sacred objects from their temples, under tall umbrellas, to be washed and purified."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta ceremonia se llama Melasti.",
          "en": "This ceremony is called Melasti."
        },
        {
          "es": "El mar se ve como un gran limpiador, que lava la suciedad del año viejo.",
          "en": "The sea is seen as a great cleanser, washing away the dirt of the old year."
