          "en": "Village guards called pecalang walk the empty streets, to make sure the rules are kept."
        },
        {
          "es": "A los visitantes se les pide que se queden en silencio dentro de sus hoteles.",
          "en": "Visitors are asked to stay quietly inside their hotels."
        },
        {
          "es": "Muchos balineses pasan el día ayunando, meditando y repasando el año que pasó.",
          "en": "Many Balinese spend the day fasting, meditating and looking back on the past year."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y de noche, sin una sola lámpara, el cielo sobre Bali se llena de estrellas.",
          "en": "And at night, with no lamps anywhere, the sky over Bali fills with stars."
